Lets the core make Browsers with windows it supplies (//browser_core/hooks.h), as tests do, and
stops Chrome's code that expects such a Browser to have a BrowserView, or the app to have Chrome's
main menu, from failing. The read_anything hunk follows Ardia's (github.com/mantrakp04/ardia,
engine/ardiacore/apply.sh, commit fce3a02ffb917d2902af4ce47b398ce8b03a440d), Apache License 2.0.

